1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (vi) Tun Pikrama bin Bendahara Paduka Raja Tun Perak[Bendahara Lubok Tanah] [Dato' Lubok Batu], Bendahara Paduka Tuan, of Buru. Granted Buru in fief for his great victory in Pasai. Appointed Bendahara in old age, c
2 CONC rippled and paralysed, in 1510. He d. at Lubok Batu, Muar, December 1511 (bur. there), having had issue, thirty-two children by a single wife, including:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Tun Bayazid bin Bendahara Paduka Tuan Tun Pikrama (eldest son). Slightly deranged.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Tun Khoja Ahmad bin Bendahara Paduka Tuan Tun Pikrama [Tun Pikrama Wira], Bendahara Paduka Raja. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Tun Puah bin Bendahara Paduka Tuan Tun Pikrama, of Rantau Ceka.
2 CONT
2 CONT A daughter (isteri baginda saudara Bendahara Paduka Raja yang bongsu) m  Paduka Sri Sultan Mansur Shah I ibni al-Marhum Sultan Muzaffar Shah
2 CONT
2 CONT Putri binti Bendahara Paduka Tuan Tun Pikrama Hang Hamzah [Tun Perpatih Kasim]
2 CONT
2 CONT Another daughter. m. as his second wife, Tun Tuah bin Hang Mahmud
