1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===RAJA KENAVAN SHAH ALAM SAYONG===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===NOTE ABOUT TITLES USED IN THIS ARTICLE:===
2 CONT '''"Megat"''' is a title given to noble people of royal descent on the ''mother's'' side but are unable from the inferior position of their fathers to take the higher title of '''"Wan"'''.
2 CONT '''"Bendahara"''', in the traditional Malay states, the chief minister, second only to the sultan in rank, power, and authority; the office of bendahara (a Sanskrit title) grew in importance during the Malacca sultanate after 1400
2 CONC .
2 CONT '''"Bendahara Paduka Raja"''' often means "Prime Minister"]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Megat'' Terawis married to Tun Bongsu Bangsawan (a daughter of Tun Saban, ruler of Upper Perak).
2 CONT From this union, ''Megat'' Biajad Mustafa was born. He later became the ''Bendahara'' Muda of Perak and was also known by the name ''Bendahara'' Muda Megat Sulung. This ''Bendahara'' Muda had two sons: ''Megat'' Shuib and ''Megat'
2 CONC ' Abdullah. Both were later appointed as ''Bendaharas'' of Perak.
2 CONT
2 CONT Following the Acheh invasion of Perak in 1619, Puteri Limau Purut was captured together with her father and other members of their royal family and was brought to Acheh. ''Megat'' Abdullah was the one who was responsible for rescu
2 CONC ing Puteri Limau Purut daughter of Sultan Mukaddam Shah of Perak and fiancé of Sultan Mansur Shah of Perak. It was during the reign of Sultan Mansur Shah that Megat Abdullah was appointed as ''Bendahara'' of Perak with the title B
2 CONC endahara Paduka Raja. However, he was widely known as Bendahara Garang.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the later part of his life, he was again remembered in history as the person leading the Perak entourage accompanying the a royal princess of Perak to marry the Raja Muda of Pahang – Raja Abdullah (son of Sultan Abdul Ghafur Mu
2 CONC haiyuddin). According to Maxwell, during Megat Abdullah’s visit to Pahang, he married a Pahang girl. From this union, one Baginda Danum was born. According to the genealogy of Orang Kaya Indera Maharaja Perba of Jelai, Pahang, one
2 CONC  of the Maharaja Perba’s ancestors was one ‘Bendahara Garang’ they were descendants of the royal house of Pagar Ruyung. It is highly likely that the Bendahara Garang here is the same Bendahara Garang of Perak as Megat Terawis (gra
2 CONC ndfather to Megat Abdullah) was a Pagar Ruyung prince. If this is true, then we have a family tie with Pahang’s Maharaja Perba Clan.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Back in Perak, Megat Abdullah Bendahara Garang had a son named Megat Menjanas. Megat Menjanas was later made Bendahara of Perak and was nicknamed Bendahara Kukut. 
2 CONT He married ''Raja Kenayan Shah Alam Sayong'' – a daughter of Sultan Muzaffar Shah II of Perak. She’s also a younger sister to both Sultan Mahmud Iskandar Shah, and, Yang Dipertuan Muda Mansur Shah of Perak. From this union, Megat 
2 CONC Terawis II was born and later was made Orang Kaya Bendahara Seri Maharaja of Perak. 
2 CONT '''
2 CONT This is where the tradition of naming Megat and Puteri as title for children from a female Raja who married a non-raja originated. However, most people fail to appreciate the fact that Megat Terawis II got his ‘Megat’ title from h
2 CONC is father who was also a ‘Megat’. The reason for this misunderstanding was that in those days, it is considered rude for one to mention or address a titled person with their personal name. Meaning to say, it is rude to address “Da
2 CONC to’ Bendahara Megat Menjanas”. The correct way of address is “Dato’ Bendahara Paduka Seri Maharaja”. The name Megat Menjanas is only known to close family members.''' So, for this case, people thought that “Megat Terawis was an of
2 CONC fspring of Raja Kenayan and Bendahara Kukut” instead of “Megat Terawis was an offpring of Raja Kenayan and Megat Menjanas”.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Terawis II had 3 sons – Megat Pendia, Megat Shamsu and Megat Abu Kassim. 
2 CONT According to Misa Melayu, Megat Terawis II died during the reign of Sultan Alauddin Mughayat Shah.
2 CONT Shortly afterwards, the Sultan died. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Terawis was succeeded by Megat Pendia as Bendahara with the title Bendahara Seri Dewa Raja. 
2 CONT Megat Pendia had 2 sons: Megat Mutabar and Megat Omar. 
2 CONT
2 CONT However the appointment of Megat Pendia to the Bendaharaship was delayed due to the clash of two Royal princes of Perak.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sultan Alauddin Mughayat Shah was succeded by his brother – reigning as Sultan Muzaffar Shah III. When Sultan Muzaffar Shah III succeeded to the Perak throne, Perak was divided into two as the younger brother of Sultan Muzaffar Sh
2 CONC ah III proclaimed himself as the Sultan of Perak – Sultan Muhammad Shah. Sultan Muzaffar Shah III fled up north to Kuala Kangsar while Sultan Muhammad Shah reigned in the South. According to MS Maxwell 24, during the reign of the 
2 CONC late Sultan Alauddin Mughayat Shah, Raja Inu (later Sultan Muzaffar Shah III) was already a ruler of Bernam – appointed by his late uncle – Sultan Mahmud Iskandar Shah. Raja Inu feels that he is more eligible than his other brothe
2 CONC rs to become Sultan of Perak as he was appointed to a minor Sultanship of Bernam. Raja Bisnu (later Sultan Muhammad Shah) – a younger brother to both Raja Radin (Sultan Alauddin Mughayat Shah) and Raja Inu, supported the eldest br
2 CONC other.
2 CONT
2 CONT As a strong supporter of Sultan Alauddin, when the Raja Inu ascended the throne as Sultan Muzaffar Shah III, Raja Bisnu refused to acknowledge the soverignity of Raja Inu. Hence, he proclaimed himself as Sultan Muhammad Shah. As f
2 CONC irst act as Sultan, Sultan Muhammad Shah appointed Megat Pendia as the Bendahara of Perak. In Kuala Kangsar, Sultan Muzaffar Shah III appointed his sister’s son – a Kedah Prince named Raja Alim as Bendahara.
2 CONT
2 CONT However, the clash between these two Sultans were not that long. Later, Sultan Muhammad Shah apologised to his elder brother and invited the latter to return to Berahman Indera and rule as the sole Sultan of Perak. Sultan Muzaffar
2 CONC  Shah III agreed. Not long after the royal princes reconciled, Perak was at war with Daeng Matteko and Sutan Berkabat. 
2 CONT
2 CONT During the war, Bendahara Megat Pendia together with the sons of Sultan Muhammad Shah – Raja Muda Iskandar and Raja Kimas were the Perak generals. The former Bendahara Raja Alim did contribute to the defence of Perak. Perak won an
2 CONC d Raja Alim was later banished to Melaka. It was during this war that the Bendahara Muda Megat Omar – son of Megat Pendia lost his life.
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Pendia was succeeded by his younger brother – Megat Abu Kassim as Bendahara. This Megat Abu Kassim is married to Long Luya Binti Daeng Usman – Seri Maharaja Lela. From this union, Megat Mansur was born (later known as Orang 
2 CONC Kaya Besar Seri Maharaja).  Megat Mutabar – son of Megat Pendia was promoted from a Temenggong to Orang Kaya Besar. The grandson of Megat Pendia was appointed as Bendahara Muda. The name of this Bendahara Muda is none other than M
2 CONC egat Muhammad Mentaha who was nicknamed as Megat Lambat Makan of Kuala Kenas.
2 CONT
2 CONT During the reign of Sultan Iskandar Zulkarnain, Megat Abu Kassim resigned as Bendahara together with several other chiefs. Following his resignation, the office of Bendahara was converted to a Royal Title – Raja Bendahara Wazirul 
2 CONC Kabir Bakal Raja Muda.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Bendahara Muda was compensated with the title Orang Kaya Besar as the title was vacant following the death of Megat Mutabar. Hence, the new Orang Kaya Besar became known as Tok Kaya Megat Lambat Makan of Kuala Kenas. He was ma
2 CONC rried firstly with Puteri Hitam Sayong (a daughter of Megat Mutabar and sister of Orang Kaya Besar Megat Gombak Marasin). Secondly, he was married to the widow of Megat Abu Kassim – Long Luya Binti Seri Maharaja Lela Daeng Usman. 
2 CONC  Megat Mentaha later married a daughter of one Tok Kaya Muda (name unknown) and begot Megat Inu (also known as Tok Kaya Senin) and Megat Kassim (Tok Nara Tior).
2 CONT
2 CONT As for today’s generation of the clan, they can trace their roots from the following individuals:
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Gombak Marasin Bin Megat Mutabar
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Muhammad Mentaha Bin Megat Omar
2 CONT wife 1: Puteri Hitam Sayong Binti Megat Mutabar
2 CONT wife 2: Long Luya Binti Daeng Usman
2 CONT wife 3: daughter of one Tok Kaya Muda
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Mansur Bin Megat Abu Kassim
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT One who intends to study the genealogy of the Megat Terawis Clan of Perak must consult the MS40333(2) of SOAS, London together with the genealogical works of 4 individuals: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wan Ismail Bin Wan Muhammad Aqib
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Ismail Bin Megat Ahmad
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Ramli Bin Megat Jaafar
2 CONT
2 CONT Megat Osman Bin Megat Abu Bakar
2 CONT
