2 CONT 1660 - 1661 H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Haji Muhammad 'Ali ibni al-Marhum Sultan Muhammad Hassan [al-Marhum Tumbang di-Rumput], Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan of Brunei Dar us-Salam. b. 159x, son of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Muhammad Hassan i
2 CONC bni al-Marhum Sultan Saif ul-Rijal Nur ul-Alam, Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan of Brunei Dar us-Salam, by a secondary wife, educ. privately. Succeeded on the death of his nephew, 1660. He was k. (garotted) on the lawns of his palace a
2 CONC t Asar, with all his male children save two infants, 7th December 1661, having had issue
