2 GIVN Tribhuwanaraja Mauliawarmadewa (Raja Dharmasraya Kerajaan Jambi)
2 NSFX Sang Sapurba
2 _MARNM Trailokyaraja
2 NICK Sang Si Perba
2 NICK Sangsapurba Trimarti Trib'Huvena
2 NICK Sri Mat Tri Bhuwana Raja Mauli Warma Dewa
2 NICK Sri Nila Pahlawan
2 NICK Srimat Tribhuwanaraja Mauli Warmadewa
2 NICK deceased
2 NICK Tribhuwanaraja Mauliwarmadewa
1 NAME Maharaja Malayu II - Tribhuwanaraja (1286-1316)
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
