1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1) Y.M. Engku Tuan [Ku Tanang] Wangsa ibni al-Marhum Sultan Zainal-Abidin (s/o Nang Roqaiya). Renounced his rights in favour of his younger brother, and served as his regent 1733-1741. m. (first) Che' Hamida [Milah
2 CONC ], Che' Puan Trengganu, elder daughter of Ganda Abu bin Paduka Sri Rama, by his wife, Siti Mariam, daughter of To' Pit. m. (second) Raja Andak, of Sukadana. He had issue, five sons and six daughters.
2 CONT
