2 CONT Sultan Saif ul-Rijal may have also adopted the son of one of his lesser wives, Dayang Bongsu. However, the actual ancestry of this line is very confused. Another account styles him as Pangiran Anak Kasim and says that he was the S
2 CONC ultanâ€™s son by the Kedayan lady from Jerudong. A third source suggests that his wife the daughter of Dayang Bongsu, not her husband Kasim:
2 CONT 6)Orang Kaya Besar Imas Kasim. m. Dayang Hitam [Bu Pasaira]. He d. at Bukit Sarang Helang (bur. there), having had issue, two sons - see Brunei 14.
