1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Yamtuan Muda Johor-Riau yang pertama.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1722 - 1728 H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan 'Ala ud-din Ri'ayat Shah bin Daing Rilaga, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau. b. as Opu Daing Marewa, third son of Opu Ten-ri Burang Daing Rilaga, by his first wife. Granted the title of Kelana Jaya P
2 CONC utra 2nd November 1720. Installed as Viceroy of the Johor Empire with the title of Yang di-Pertuan Muda, 4th October 1722. m. (first) 1722, Y.M. Tun Encik binti Dato' Bendahara Tun 'Abdu'l Jamal, Ungku Encik Ayu, a widow of H.H. P
2 CONC aduka Sri Sultan Ibrahim Shah ibni al-Marhum Yam Tuan Muda Raja Bajau, Sultan of Johor, Pahang and Lingga, and daughter of Y.M. Tun 'Abdu'l Jamal bin Dato' Bendahara 'Abdu'l Majid, Dato' Bendahara Sri Maharaja. m. (second) …He d. 
2 CONC at Pitung Island, 7th August 1728 (bur. Sungai Baru), having had issue, two sons and two daughters
2 CONT --------------------
