1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1) Y.M. Opu La Mupa Unuk [Lemampak], Tun Engku Kelana Encik Unuk (s/o Tun Encik). m. in Selangor, a Kedah princess. He was k. (poisoned) in Perak, 1739, having had issue:
