1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Memimpin adik-adiknya membantu perang Sultan Zainuddin di Matan, dan Sultan Sulaiman di Riau, dan kemudiannya Sultan Kedah terhadap serangan Raja Kecil dari Siak. Gugur dalam perang Kedah dan dimakamkan di Langgar,
2 CONC  Kedah.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Daeng Parani (died ca. 1726) was one of the five Bugis brothers from Makassar, Sulawesi, who established political dominance over the royal houses of Peninsular Malaysia. Daing Parani became personally embroiled in the politics of
2 CONC  the Johor-Riau Sultanate in the early 18th century.
2 CONT
2 CONT More info: [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daeng_Parani]
2 CONT --------------------
