1 OCCU Sultan Terengganu (7) 1831-36
1 TITL Sultan
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sultan Terengganu- 1831-1836
2 CONT
2 CONT 1831 - 1837 H.H. Paduka Sri Tuanku Sultan Mansur Shah II ibni al-Marhum Sultan Zainal-Abidin [al-Marhum Mansur], Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Besar of Trengganu, son of H.H. Paduka Sri Tuanku Sultan Zainal-Abidin II ibni al-Marhum S
2 CONC ultan Mansur, Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Besar of Trengganu, by his second wife, Cik Puan Muda, educ. privately. Granted the title of Tengku Bendahara Paduka Raja by his nephew, 1830. Succeeded on the death of his nephew as senior
2 CONC  ruler, 30th January 1831. Installed as Yang di-Pertuan Tua, 31st January 1831. Crowned as Sultan Mansur II and sole ruler on the expulsion of his nephew, Sultan 'Umar, 1831. m. 1831, H.H. Tengku Sulong binti Tengku Muhammad, Teng
2 CONC ku Ampuan Besar (b. 1787; d. 17th August 1864), widow of his elder brother, H.H. Paduka Sri Tuanku Sultan 'Abdu'l-Rahman ibni al-Marhum Sultan Zainal-Abidin, Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Besar of Trengganu, daughter of H.H. Tengku M
2 CONC uhammad ibni al-Marhum Sultan Mansur, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Kelantan, by his wife, Cik Ku Wan Teh, Che Puan Kelantan, daughter of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Long Yunus ibni al-Marhum Raja Long Sulaiman, Raja and Yang di-Pertuan of K
2 CONC elantan. He d. at Balik Bukit, Kuala Trengganu, 8th March 1837 (bur. Shaikh Ibrahim Cemetery), having had issue, three sons and four daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: [http://www.royalark.net/Malaysia/treng10.htm]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sultan Mansur Syah II. Sultan Terengganu ke7; 1831-37 bersama Sultan Omar.
