2 CONC ing himself on the throne, 19th August 1779. He lost his reason soon afterwards and was placed under supervision. m. (first) before 1760, Y.A.M. Tengku Sani binti Tengku Busu, elder daughter of his paternal uncle, Y.A.M. Tengku Ib
