2 CONT 3) Y.M. Sri Paduka Tun Koris bin Dato’ Bendahara Paduka Raja Tun ‘Abdu’l Majid [Engku Endau], Dato’ Bendahara Paduka Raja of Endau (cre. 1803) (s/o Tun Besar), educ. privately. m. (first) Y.M. Tun Chik binti Dato’ Temenggong Sri M
2 CONC aharaja Tun ‘Abdu’l Jamal [Engku Mai], Encik Puan Kechil, daughter of Y.M. Sri Paduka Tun ‘Abdu’l Jamal bin Dato’ Bendahara Sri Maharaja Tun Abbas, Dato’ Temenggong Paduka Raja of Riau, by his second wife, Daing Maimuna, daughter 
2 CONC of Opu Daing Parani bin Opu Ten-ri Burang Daing Rilaga. m. (second) Y.M. Tun Mariam binti Dato’ Temenggong Sri Maharaja Daing ‘Abdu’l Rahman, Che’ Puan Bendahara Paduka Raja (d. after 1822), daughter of H.H. Daing ‘Abdu’l Rahman b
2 CONC in Dato’ Temenggong Sri Maharaja Tun ‘Abdu’l Hamid, Dato’ Temenggong Sri Maharaja. He d. before 11th March 1807 (bur. at the Royal Cemetery, Kuala Pahang), having had issue, two sons and one daughter by his second wife.
2 CONT
