2 CONT 1) H.H. Paduka Sri Raja Istri Pangiran Anak Putri Nur Alam Murat un-nisa [Muratun] (d/o Saleha). m. H.H. Al-Wasik Malik ul-Alam Paduka Sri Sultan Muhammad Jamal ul-Alam I ibni al-Marhum Sultan Muhammad Taj ud-din, Sultan and Yang 
2 CONC di-Pertuan of Brunei Dar us-Salam (d. at Brunei, 10th November 1804, bur. there at the Royal Mausoleum, Jalan Khutbah Makam Di-Raja), son of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Muhammad Taj ud-din ibni al-Marhum Sultan Omar ‘Ali Saif ud-din, S
2 CONC ultan and Yang di-Pertuan of Brunei Dar us-Salam, by his first wife, H.H. Paduka Sri Raja Istri Pangiran Anak Bulan, daughter of Duli Pangiran di-Gadong Sahib ul-Mal ul-Mulk ul-Adli Pangiran Anak ‘Abdu’l. She had issue, one son an
2 CONC d one daughter.
2 CONT
