1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pg Anak Marali atau '''Marsala''' adalah putera kepada Al-Marhum Sultan Muhammad Kanzul 'Alam [Sultan Brunei ke-21, 1807-1822] dengan salah seorang isteri baginda yang bukan gahara. Pg Anak Marali ini menurut catat
2 CONC an Inggeris dipanggil juga dengan nama '''Markarle / Marsale'''. James Brooke pernah menceritakan bagaimana perpisahan Pg Muda Hashim ibni Sultan Muhammad Kanzul 'Alam dengan adik-adiknya Pg Anak Badaruddin dan Pg Anak Marali yang
2 CONC  penuh emosi: ''"... Muda Hashim was pleased, directed two of his brothers to accompany the governor, and prepared letters for his royal nephew and chief. After many tedious formalities and an affectionate farewell, Mr. Brooke got
2 CONC  away from Kuching on July 14, 1842, and immediately sailed for the capital. The parting between Muda Hashim and his two brothers was very touching, and is thus feelingly described by Mr. Brooke: The Rajah addressed a few words to
2 CONC  his brother, requesting him to tell the Sultan that his heart was always with him; that he could never separate from him, whether far or near; and he was, and always had been, true to his son. Bedrudin (Pg Anak Badaruddin) then r
2 CONC ose, and, approaching the Rajah, seated himself close to him, bending his head to the ground over the Rajah's hand, which he had grasped. The Rajah hastily withdrew his hand, and, clasping round, embraced, kissing his neck Both we
2 CONC re greatly agitated, and both wept; and I could have wept for company, for it was no display of State ceremony, but genuine feeling. It is seldom, very seldom, they show their feelings, and the effect was the more touching from be
2 CONC ing unexpected. It is a part of our nature-our better nature to feel when we see others feel Pangeran Marsale (Pg Anak Marali) followed. Both brothers parted from Muda Mahomed (Pg Muda Muhammad) in the same way, and they certainly
2 CONC  rose in my opinion from this token of affection towards each other. My adieux followed. We all rose; the Rajah accompanied us to the wharf, and as we embarked, I could see the tears slowly steal from his eyes. I could not help ta
2 CONC king his hand and bidding him to be of good cheer: he smiled in a friendly manner, pressed my hand, and I stepped into my boat."'' Pg Anak Marsala juga berperadian dengan Raja Isteri Pg Anak Noralam, Sultan Muhammad 'Alam @ Raja A
2 CONC pi, Pg Bendahara Pg Muda Hashim, Pg Bendahara Pg Muda Muhammad Digantisan, Pg Muda Pasar, Pg Muda Hasan, Pg Muda Muhammad Ahad, Pg Anak Badaruddin, Pg Anak Jaafar, Pg Anak Ismail, Pg Anak Jalaluddin, Pg Anak Puteri Mariam, Pg Anak
2 CONC  Pasah, Pg Anak Fatimah, Pg Babu Jubaidah, Pg Anak Puteri Siti Banum, Pg Babu Simpul, dan lain-lain lagi.
2 CONT
2 CONT والله أعلمُ
