1 NAME
2 GIVN
2 NICK Gat sa Li-Han
2 NICK Gat sa Lian
2 NICK Gat sa Liang
2 NICK Gat Silayan
2 NICK Gat Silayan Maginto
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1680
2 ADDR
3 STAE Lakanate of Tondo
1 OCCU Gat
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hwangdom of Li-Han
1 OCCU Chieftain of Li-Han (Liang, Lian)
1 TITL Gat sa Lian
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gat Chalian (also Gat Salian), son of Gat Timog and Dayang Lahat, is the chieftain of Li-Han (primitive Chinese name of Malolos in Bulacan, Philippines). His descendants retained the whole name composition Gatsalia
2 CONC n with a slight variation that made it to Gatchalian which is being adopted by the succeeding generations.
2 CONT
2 CONT The kingdom of Lakan Dula stretched from Tondo to Pampanga and the chieftains were drawn from his royal kinship and given the title Gat.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gat Chalian, Gat Salihan or Gat Salian was actually a title of the princes who ruled the ancient Li-Han.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=iLtuAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA186&dq=Gat+sa+Li-Han&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjhlYfkoo3oAhXnyosBHZF_CQIQ6AEIMjAB#v=onepage&q=Gat%20sa%20Li-Han&f=false Date accessed: March 9, 2020.
2 CONT * Olmos, Arturo T., Tiongson Ancestry (1600 A.D. - 2000 A.D.) copy of typescript, unpublished document. 2000
2 CONT * Gatbonton family tree
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Photos courtesy of:''
2 CONT * https://commons.m.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boxer_codex.jpg#mw-jump-to-license portayal of the maginoo or ruling class, Boxer codex
2 CONT * Gatbonton clan
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Gat Silayan Maginto and his wife Potongan were among the first settlers and rulers of Pakil, Laguna.
2 CONT
2 CONT Before the Spaniards came, Paete was said to be a village under Gat Lakampawid, a native ruler from the ancient village of Lihan, a relative to Gatmaitim, Gat Silayan, Gat Pakil, the rulers of old town of Pakil. These native ruler
2 CONC s from Old Lihan (now Malolos, Bulacan) was scattered along the suburbs of Kingdom of Tondo in the south and settled there. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://ilovepakil.webs.com/historyofpakil.htm Date accessed: September 24, 2019.
2 CONT * https://paete.gov.ph/about-paete/ Date accessed: September 24, 2019.
