2 CONC h Lakan Dula, he was one of three Rajahs who fought the Spaniards during the colonization of the Philippines in the 16th century.  After making peace with the Spaniards in 1571, he led a revolt against them in 1574, which referred
2 CONC  to as the Sulaiman revolt.
