2 CONC  the genealogy of Dato Godam from MenteriPutih to Menteri Omar, Pehin Orang Kaya Di GadongAwangAliwaddin and so on. Then MenteriUban in Sarawak as the pioneer of search for the kinsman and beneficiaries of Dato Gadom in Pagaruyung
2 CONC  and in Malaysia.
